	(descr "Miniature slide switch, SPDT, right angle, SK-12D07 type (e.g. XUNPU SK-12D07VG8, LCSC C49284741): body 8.7 x 4.5 x 4.7 mm, pins on 2.0 mm centres under the body's middle, frame lugs 8.3 mm apart, handle 2 mm wide and 8 mm long (VG8) out of the body's front face, 2 mm travel. Land pattern per the XUNPU drawing (pins 0.5 x 0.3 mm: 0.9 mm holes; lugs 0.4 mm thick: 1.5 mm holes, which also take the 8.2 mm lug spacing of other SK-12D07 makes). Pads trimmed (pins 1.3 x 1.8 mm, so a 0.2 mm track passes between them; lugs 2.1 mm) so a side-view LED can sit between the pins and the board edge (main board v20). Pin 2 = common; non-shorting.")
